BT 1 0 0 1 0 63.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Eight high-severity NodeBB flaws went public alongside exploit code; Aikido Security's AI pentest agents found them all in a) Tj T* (six-hour source review. They include XSS, authentication bypasses and unauthorised data exposure: three are) Tj T* (unauthenticated, one lets an ordinary member reach the admin dashboard \(a client-side-only block on the homepage setting) Tj T* (could be sidestepped to load /admin\), and separate bugs exposed private messages and private categories. All affect versions) Tj T* (before 4.14.0; none has a CVE and no attacks were reported. Upgrade to NodeBB 4.14.2, rotate admin credentials, and audit) Tj T* (for unauthorised admin-panel access and private-data scraping.) Tj T* ET
